        <div class="hero-sections" id="about-us">
            <div class="heading">ABOUT US</div>
            <div class="content">
                <div class="content-body">
                    <img id="img" src="/assets/about-us-img.png" alt="">
                    <div class="details">
                        <div class="details-part details-part-1">
                            <b style="color: #d4ac2b; font-size: 24px;">CODEUTSAVA</b> is an annual event organized by the Turing Club of Programmers. It brings together like-minded coders from across the nation to foster a thriving coding culture with workshops, hackathons, gaming battles, MIC sessions, and more.
                        </div>
                        <div class="details-part details-part-2">
                            The heart of <b style="color: #d4ac2b; font-size: 22px;">CODEUTSAVA</b> is the <b style="color: #d4ac2b; font-size: 22px;">28-hour hackathon</b>, where participants build ambitious ideas at speed and scale. This year's edition features a <b style="color: #d4ac2b; font-size: 22px;">33 L+</b> prize pool including <b style="color: #d4ac2b; font-size: 24px;">1.5-2 L</b> cash prizes.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="other">
                    <div class="other-parts">
                        <img src="/assets/symbol-2.png">
                        <p>CREATIVE DESIGN</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="other-parts">
                        <img src="/assets/symbol-3.png">
                        <p>WE MAKE BEST RESULT</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="other-parts">
                        <img src="/assets/symbol-1.png">
                        <p>INNOVATIVE CODING</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

